Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||08-31-2000||03:29 PM||||i know burnouts are bad for a car, but nothing makes people pay attention to a good long smoky burnout! last night after work an associate of mine was meeting up with some friends in the parking lot, and this guy with a civic was squealing his tires some. well, everyone over there (probably 12 people) paid attention to me when i started my flowmastered beast, so i decided to make an impressive exit. i started driving away, going about 5 mph then clutched it,, revved to about 4500, and clutch dropped, effectively doing a rolling burnout. they were very impressed, no one paid attention to the civic after that. now, people i work with always ask about my car, which is cool because where i work the porsches, vipers, and ferraris in the parking lot are not uncommon. i will try to get some burnout videos soon, mmm'kay?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1012904&a=7460599&p=25516673"> ||||reg||1
