Z||000008||Standard||09-04-2000||05:24 AM||||I haven't gotten the guts to drop the clutch at 4500 and see how well a drivetrain with 150,000 miles on it will stand up.. but I've gotten some pretty good squealage by letting it out quick (not dropping it) at 3000-3500... <P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 150,000 miles and counting!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">    <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
